<title>MACEDONIA: SOCCER-ROMANIA BEAT MACEDONIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ROMANIA BEAT MACEDONIA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SKOPJE 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Romania beat Macedonia 3-0 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup European group eight qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Gheorghe Popescu 37, 45, 90 penalty</p>
<p>Group standings (tabulate under - played, won, drawn, lost, goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Romania	  3   3   0   0   10   0   9</p>
<p> Ireland	  3   2   1   0    8   0   7</p>
<p> Macedonia	5   2   1   2   15   8   7</p>
<p> Lithuania	3   2   0   1    4   4   6</p>
<p> Iceland	  4   0   2   2    1   7   2</p>
<p> Liechtenstein  4   0   0   4    2  21   0</p>
</text>
